      "revision": 1370199136,
      "text": "Calamus deerratus is a dioecious rattan species within the family Arecaceae, it is widespread in Tropical Africa and it is the only species within the genus Calamus that is native to Tropical Africa."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Calamus deerratus",
